message: >-
  Please cite this research archive and the specific paper used. Cite the
  original literature separately for imported theorems.
title: "A Marked-Width Reduction of Mandelbrot Local Connectivity: Public Research Archive"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Wesney
    given-names: Matthew Robert
version: "2026.07.27"
date-released: "2026-07-27"
url: "https://github.com/dovvnloading/loops-research-archive"
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  A source-locked research program toward Mandelbrot local connectivity,
  including a 214-page conditional reduction, companion papers on canonical
  localization, rooted-end compactification, and protected planar carriers,
  a machine-readable proof-obligation ledger, adversarial audits,
  counterexamples, and reproducible computational diagnostics. The MLC
  conjecture remains open.
keywords:
  - Mandelbrot set
  - local connectivity
  - complex dynamics
  - renormalization
  - polynomial-like mappings
  - extremal width
  - prime ends
  - proof ledger
